 "text": "Hey there, how are you? Great plan. Pick a scenic but accessible spot, check the access terms, and think about what you' like to eat and drink. Then lean into that. Pick a hay bale for sitting, and spread blanket each on one. Fill a little cooler with some of those treats. Musical beats the noise level, and she'll appreciate the effort. An audiobook on her earphones could work too. Then keep the idea a secret until the day before, so she doesn't overthink it. Pick a nice spot that's easy to get to, so she doesn't have long walk after dinner.",
